{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1747.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"601ecb6fab307a6ac0fb6d35eb3588ffa11cb7dbd0f87e6e449694c0f1c7cc5c","ja":"下見のお誘い","zh":"踩点邀请","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1747.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"4a88167546340ff055a0a2665baa2595ef4c6eb66b8bfc99c63b50ce7dbf2674","ja":"お仕事お疲れさま。\n……あのね、伊織さん、このあと時間ある？","zh":"工作辛苦了。\n……那个，伊织，待会儿有空吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1747.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"5a5b3c62e35c70f62dd339049c0dd973e9a2dacc9cff1f5965100b00463d2c51","ja":"そうね……特に用事はないけど。\nどうかしたの？","zh":"是啊……倒也没什么特别的事。\n怎么了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1747.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"cfebe40f1426a7478164cc1bb37a3ce27b8fa5d84affef913e910b79694d39ee","ja":"桃子と話してたんだけど、\n3人でピクニックに行きたいなーって！","zh":"我刚才和桃子聊了聊，\n想3个人一起去野餐呢～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1747.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"1436430c3416ebbab17dbd138ad8b8fa4c109b8ae287f03ef8cce5ab38ed8a7e","ja":"今から？　ずいぶん急ね。","zh":"从现在开始？真突然呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1747.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"5d2310eef195950b53ba4cccb14725b999a658734fe72200ab5aecd0968d7556","ja":"あ、でも今日は予行練習だよ。\n本番はカー……じゃなくって！","zh":"啊，不过今天只是预演哦。\n正式上阵是狂……不对啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1747.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"34a79b5976f0bcaca6a2172e438b589bd128e31b89bef25084bf06a03ed598a2","ja":"え～っと～……\nか、カーネーションを見に行きたいねって！","zh":"那个～……\n说、说想去看康乃馨！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1747.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"80ec72c14fb888f730632b1ecb0ad5379a20f464b612432825527c8f855652ef","ja":"……カーネーション？","zh":"……康乃馨？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1747.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"6e5b9e28fdc2bd23e19839708738ecb7634654e66c76ff7ea79e2ef1d80798a2","ja":"えっと……そ、そろそろ咲いてる時期なのかなって。","zh":"那个……我、我在想是不是差不多到开花的时期了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1747.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"f8fe501e2aeb9c6e519bae2e9c38f6d9c4a563e6d9a49fe8d16ebfd595b52104","ja":"……よくわからないけど、とにかく\nふたりは『ピクニックの下見』がしたいのね？","zh":"……虽然不太明白，但总之\n你们两个是想去“野餐踩点”，对吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1747.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"4fabb21551dbd27aabedd10736c1a67ef610cab7cc74cf89de20d14b1fdd0b75","ja":"う、うん！　ねえ、伊織ちゃん、行かない？\nお昼ごはんも一緒に食べたいなーって。","zh":"嗯、嗯！那个，伊织，不去吗？\n我还想着可以一起吃午饭呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1747.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"aa70ec7b2aa45ea44c669b548abd98cdecafa11940a036219952b5f5fdd733ed","ja":"その……桃子も、3人で遊べたらうれしいし。","zh":"那个……桃子要是能3个人一起玩，也会开心的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1747.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"790aef9feba7e0dd5f2be48d4c7a899083cae0c839bd622371d6fb9a4f16a32f","ja":"な、何よ？　ふたりしてそんなに熱く見つめてきて……\nわかったわよ、一緒に行くってば！","zh":"怎、怎么啦？两个人用那么热切的眼神看着我……\n我知道了啦，一起去就是了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1747.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"8c75c6aec5d29a22bdcf17e87d2ad57990b4160895d0a3d87ad4cdbaacc9611f","ja":"やったーっ！\nありがとう、伊織さん。","zh":"太好啦——！\n谢谢你，伊织。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1747.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"4ee5b274e1c5d0cdec2a63c92781090a268afbb2353e4060f195389c09d3e18a","ja":"どうせ外に出るなら……そうね、\nせっかくだし、ご飯もテイクアウトしたらどうかしら？","zh":"既然都要出门了……也是呢，\n难得出去一趟，不如顺便把饭也打包带走怎么样？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1747.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"33763e2e806179d7b2ef6004226413f65ce1fc481997ad2e610bac30932bdf01","ja":"さんせー！\nそれじゃあ、ぱぱーって着替えて、行きましょ～！","zh":"赞成——！\n那我们就赶快换好衣服，出发吧～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
